## 🔧 Technical Highlights

### Query Optimization

**Before:**
```sql
-- Sequential scan, 500ms
SELECT * FROM documents WHERE title LIKE '%budget%';
```

**After:**
```sql
-- Index scan, 30ms
CREATE INDEX idx_documents_title_fts 
ON documents USING gin(to_tsvector('english', title));

SELECT * FROM documents 
WHERE to_tsvector('english', title) @@ to_tsquery('budget');
```

### Caching Pattern

```python
@cached(ttl=3600, key_prefix="document")
def get_document(doc_id: int):
    # Automatically cached for 1 hour
    # Cache key: document:<doc_id>
    return db.query(Document).get(doc_id)
```

### CDN Asset Versioning

```python
# Content-based versioning
version = hashlib.md5(content).hexdigest()[:8]
url = cdn.get_asset_url("style.css", version=version)
# Result: https://cdn.ios-system.com/style.css?v=a3d8f9e2
```

